        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/dc4da7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-20T14:30:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I received my Enhanced Edition yesterday, knocked out my first two solo plays last night, and am now salivating at the prospect of playing Sentinels with other equally enthusiastic dudes (or dudesses) in the greater Madison area.</p><p>I sporadically attend the Saturday gaming sessions at Pegasus Games in Madison and second Saturday gaming sessions at I'm Board in Middleton. I've also been known to check out Labyrinth Games in Baraboo while waiting for my clothes to dry at the laundomat. I would be down for some weekend appointment gaming at any of those locations, and will likely be attending the Gaming Hoopla in Janesville Saturday, Sept. 29.</p><p>I've seen posts of people mentioning Madison game shops and conventions before, so I know there are other Madisonians out there. Drop me a line and we'll get our game on. (I call Haka, by the way!)</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
