        "created_at": "2012-09-20T15:25:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>First, welcome to the site!  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"></p>\n<p>I hope you find some folks to introduce to the game - or even other folks in your area who already know of it.</p>\n<p>And I'm <strong>very </strong>glad to see some Haka-love!  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=9\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\"></p>",
