        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/dc4da7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-20T16:36:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Actually just found out that the husband of the office coordinator at work also ordered Sentinels and got it yesterday. There's a good possibility that we'll team up in the near future.</p><p>I'm thinking of talking to the owner of my LGS about running a demo day. Last time I went there there were multiple games of MTG and the Resident Evil deck-building game going on so I imagine there'd be a built-in audience.</p><p>(Haka was the man against Ambuscade - and that was without Savage Mana or any of his other more interesting cards coming into play. I think's his joyful expression on many of the cards that make me such a fan. Or maybe it's the Hippopotoman.)</p>",
