        "id": 38873,
        "name": "Flex Apollo",
        "username": "Flex_Apollo",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/dc4da7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-21T14:40:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'll have to check that out. Played an epic solo game of Haka, Tachyon, and Visionary versus Ambuscade in Megaopolis last night, which has only further fed my desire to get the game in front of other gamers. I'll keep you all in the loop about any possible progress on that front.</p><p>On a tangentially related note, I just preregistered for the Gaming Hoopla in Janesville Saturday, Sept. 29. I'll be there all day with my Enhanced Edition in hand trying to find other Sentinels fans to play with. Janesville is about two hours north of Chicago in case there are any Illinois folks interested in what looks like a packed event: www.gaminghoopla.com. Drop me a line if you're planning on attending and we can get our game on.</p><p>By the way, Janesville is a mere five-and-a-half hours away from St. Louis, for those who are (hopefully) curious.</p>",
